OL,3,ADWP confirms cyber attack forced it to
OL,4,Atake pension and benefits systems
OL,5,Aoffline
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,8,Fconfirms a cyber attack forced it take
OL,9,Fsome of its services offline - here's
OL,10,Fwhat we still don't know
OL,12,FPip, pension and universal credit
OL,13,Fsystems are still down - we look at how
OL,14,Fthe incident unfolded
OL,16,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,17,FMcFadden says "it's right" that the
OL,18,Fgovernment took its time to establish
OL,19,Fthat the incident was a cyber attack
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
