OL,3,ADWP confirms cyber attack forced it to
OL,4,Atake pension and benefits systems
OL,5,Aoffline
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement, it says there was "an
OL,8,Fattempt to gain unauthorised access to
OL,9,Four systems" - and it warns people to
OL,10,Fremain vigilant to scams
OL,12,FThe government doesn't currently
OL,13,Fbelieve personal information was
OL,14,Faccessed, and says payments aren't
OL,15,Faffected
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
