OL,3,ATwo staff killed in Israeli strike on
OL,4,AGaza medical clinic, MSF says
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo workers for the medical charity
OL,7,FMedecins Sans Frontieres (MSF) have
OL,8,Fbeen killed in an Israeli strike in
OL,9,FGaza, according to the organisation.
OL,11,FMSF said the strike was a direct hit on
OL,12,Fone of the charity's clinics, the
OL,13,Flocation of which was known by the
OL,14,FIsraeli military.
OL,16,FIn a statement, the Israel Defense
OL,17,FForces (IDF) said the two people were
OL,18,FHamas operatives "acting as security
OL,19,Fguards at a clinic operated by MSF".
OL,20,FThe IDF added the strike was "not
OL,21,Fdirected at a hospital" and caused no
OL,22,Fdamage to medical infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
