OL,4,AGaza medical clinic, MSF says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the World Health
OL,7,FOrganization (WHO) said that attacks on
OL,8,Fhealth facilities and health workers in
OL,9,FGaza were "outrageous and
OL,10,Funacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
