OL,3,AOpenAI counter-sues Apple over alleged
OL,4,Atheft of trade secrets
OL,5,
OL,6,FChatGPT-maker OpenAI has counter-sued
OL,7,FApple, alleging that the iPhone maker
OL,8,Fstole trade secrets through a former
OL,9,Femployee.
OL,11,FIn a federal lawsuit filed in July,
OL,12,FApple sued the artificial intelligence
OL,13,F(AI) company and two of its employees
OL,14,Fwho previously worked for Apple,
OL,15,Fclaiming it had engaged in a "pattern
OL,16,Fof theft" of proprietary information.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
